OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-Ukraine post from Reform
OL,4,Asupporter's account was unofficial,
OL,5,Asays party
OL,6,
OL,7,FA social media post attacking Ukraine
OL,8,Ffrom a "Reform UK Alyn and Deeside and
OL,9,FWrexham" account was run by a party
OL,10,Fsupporter with no official position in
OL,11,FReform, the party has said.
OL,13,FThe post, on Facebook, accuses Ukraine
OL,14,Fof corruption, says no more money or
OL,15,Fweapons should be sent to the country
OL,16,Fand calls for the lifting of sanctions
OL,17,Fagainst Russia.
OL,19,FReform said the account was "not
OL,20,Fofficial" and that the post was
OL,21,F"contrary to our policy".
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
